.TH GTEATIME 1 "November, 2026" "gteatime 1.0.4" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
gteatime \- lightweight GTK 3 system-tray tea and coffee timer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gteatime
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gteatime
is a small GTK 3 desktop timer for tea and coffee presets inspired by
.I kteatime.
It runs as a tray application through the
.I XAppStatusIcon
of
.I libxapp,
which works with XApp status applets and with the
.I XEmbed
system tray protocol on X11.
.PP
Left and right click on the tray icon open the preset menu.  The tray
icon shows whether a timer is running or idle.
.PP
When the timer finishes, a desktop notification is shown.
.SH OPTIONS
This program currently has no command-line options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/bin/gteatime
Program executable.
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/gteatime.desktop
Desktop entry.
.TP
.I /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/gteatime.svg
Main application icon.
.TP
.I /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/gteatime-on.svg
Systray icon when timer is on.
.TP
.I /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/gteatime-off.svg
Systray icon when timer is off.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
The desktop environment must provide either an XApp status applet or
an X11 system tray manager.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kteatime (1)
